Package: pyrastats
Title: Statistical Kernels Built with pyrabind
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Igor", "Ptak", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "igor@example.com")
Description: Statistical kernels (Ridge regression, robust summaries, pairwise Euclidean distances, nullable dataframe standardization, and Arrow export) built from a single C++20 pyrabind source file.
License: BSD_3_clause + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LinkingTo: cpp11
SystemRequirements: C++20
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
